# Two video screens combine texture playback, spatial audio and emissive mesh lighting.
# Press Play and focus the Game panel to fly around the gallery.
# WASD flies, Q/E descends or ascends, Space ascends, RMB looks, and Shift boosts speed.
# The main camera owns the flight script and carries the spatial audio listener.
# The bundled MP4 clips are shared resources referenced from Resources/Video/Demos.

